competitors.description:
Not all blockchains face the same quantum risk.

@turbahn in @Decrypt: Bitcoin's UTXO model has a near-term workaround. Ethereum doesn't. Every account that's ever transacted has its public key permanently on-chain.

Institutions need to build toward this now. https://t.co/AIF8rJVcJn

